# gmux project roots — one directory per line, scanned one level deep.
#
# This is a file rather than an exported $GMUX_ROOTS on purpose. The `bind g`
# binding in .tmux.conf runs gmux through `tmux run-shell`, which is a bare
# `sh -c` that sources no shell rc — exported variables and shell functions are
# both invisible there. A config file is read at invocation time, so it works
# from tmux bindings, the Übersicht widget, cron, and interactive shells alike.
#
# Roots that do not exist are skipped silently, so every machine's roots can be
# listed here and each machine quietly uses the subset it actually has. A root
# needing a path that cannot be published belongs in ~/.config/gmux/config.d/
# instead, which gmux merges with this file.

~/greg_projects

# Work laptop only; absent on every other machine.
~/frontapp
